                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0dcbff66-0333-37ff-aa83-02e963dff625",
                        "entry_id": "63555b93-84a9-3f51-9840-0d401c05c841",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to send something (secretly)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "25c6e6ed-daf4-4d66-8875-8e4b38da812d",
                                "sense_id": "0dcbff66-0333-37ff-aa83-02e963dff625",
                                "text": "Я ду́маю, Анто́н Анто́нович, что здесь то́нкая и бо́льше полити́ческая причи́на. Э́то зна́чит вот что: Росси́я… да… хо́чет вести́ войну́, и министерия-то, вот ви́дите, и подосла́ла чино́вника, что́бы узна́ть, нет ли где изме́ны.",
                                "translation": "It's my opinion, Anton Antonovich, that it's a deep political move, and it means—let me see that—Russia . . . yes, that's it ... Russia wants to make war, and the Government has surreptitiously sent an official to see if there's any disaffection anywhere.",
                                "english": "It's my opinion, Anton Antonovich, that it's a deep political move, and it means—let me see that—Russia . . . yes, that's it ... Russia wants to make war, and the Government has surreptitiously sent an official to see if there's any disaffection anywhere."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
